   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Airmail Special On The Fly**: back after 369 archived shows (2521 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Dawg's Rag**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Mill Town Flood**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Crown Of Thorns**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **How Long Have I Been Waiting On You**: back after 96 archived shows (671 days); rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **If Your Hair Is Too Long**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Ashland Breakdown**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2026-07-31.billystrings2026-07-31G-Man** (recommended): audience recording; 26 songs; 156 min [1]\n- **billystrings2026-07-31**: source not stated; 25 songs; 158 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Show took place at Bethel Woods Center For The Arts; the notes give a two-set list opening with The Fire On My Tongue [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2026-07-31.billystrings2026-07-31G-Man**: taped by G-Man; transferred by G-Man; source: Aud> Audio Technica AT-2020> Tascam DR-40X [1]\n- **billystrings2026-07-31**: taped by Marc Geanoules; transferred by Marc Geanoules; source: DAUD [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by AllEvents: [Billy Strings - 2 Day Pass at Bethel Woods Center For The Arts](https://allevents.in/bethel/billy-strings-2-day-pass-at-bethel-woods-center-for-the-arts/2400029607696339) [4]",
